**Conclusion:** eth3 was brought up during container initialization, then subsequently taken down (carrier_changes=2 = one up + one down). ospfd is completely healthy — the OSPF neighbor loss was a cascade of the physical interface going DOWN, not an ospfd crash. Restarting ospfd would accomplish nothing.

=== DIAGNOSIS ===
